Subject: HoldItemTrigger: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with player EntityScheduler

AE PATCH REASON: SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater makes code incompatible with Folia region-threaded architecture and crashes at runtime (UnsupportedOperationException from stripped SchedulerUtils). Lombok @Generated annotation is decompiler noise.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with player.getScheduler().runDelayed(EffectsHandler.getInstance(), task, null, delay) for deferred inventory-click and join checks. Remove @Generated annotation. Rename obfuscated vars (event, player, slot, heldSlot, currentItem, cursor).
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: SchedulerUtils → Player EntityScheduler. LOMBOK: @Generated removed. RF: var rename. No behavior change.

